  "term": "Daoism",
  "definition": "Daoism is presented here as a tradition of self-cultivation centered on transforming the heart-mind through embodied practice and changes in perspective. In this account, Daoist cultivation links bodily practice, awareness, qi, and spirit as connected aspects of a way of living.",
